COMMENT ON COLUMN customer_action.error_code IS 'Problem code when not SUCCEEDED';
COMMENT ON COLUMN customer_action.result_id IS 'Id of the record created downstream (payment, payee, standing order...)';
COMMENT ON COLUMN customer_action.auth_age_seconds IS 'Seconds since the customer''s last authentication when the action ran';
COMMENT ON COLUMN customer_action.acr IS 'Authentication context class of the token';
COMMENT ON COLUMN customer_action.channel IS 'WEB or MOBILE';
